title: "[Activity] ThrowPattern.Rewrite - Fixed of Manual" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
vars: {
  d2-legend: {
    f: Fixed {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
    m: Manual {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"}
  }
}
start: "" {shape: circle; width: 20; style: {fill: black; stroke: "#9ca3af"}}
q1: "Throw<T>, niet ThrowExactly?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: ThrowExactly<T> requires the exact exception type\n(proof: throw-exactly)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q2: "Precies één typeargument?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: Throw without exactly one type argument\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q3: "Vorm x.Should().Throw<T>()?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: Throw<T>(...) is not in the form x.Should().Throw<T>()\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q4: "Resultaat weggegooid?" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: The result of Throw<T>() is used (.Which, .And, ...)\n(proof: chain, value-used)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q5: "Subject niet gebouwd met Invoking(...)?" {shape: diamond}
m5: "Manual: The subject is built with Invoking(...)\n(proof: invoking)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q6: "Subject is Action of Func naar referentietype?" {shape: diamond}
m6: "Manual: The subject is not an Action or a Func returning a reference type\n(proof: value-func)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q7: "Geen becauseArgs, geen waarde-argumenten op Throw?" {shape: diamond}
m7: "Manual: becauseArgs of benoemde argumenten\n(proof: because-args)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
q8: "Volgt .WithMessage(...) direct?" {shape: diamond}
f0: "Fixed: Should.Throw<T>(act[, because])\n(proof: simple, because, func, lambda)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
w1: "Geen becauseArgs, één waarde op WithMessage?" {shape: diamond}
mw1: "Manual: WithMessage(...) with becauseArgs\n(proof: message-because-args)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
w2: "Patroon is een constante string?" {shape: diamond}
mw2: "Manual: pattern is not a string constant\n(proof: message-variable)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
w3: "Alleen een * vooraan of achteraan?" {shape: diamond}
mw3: "Manual: wildcards other than a leading or trailing *\n(proof: message-wildcard)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
sel: "Welk patroon?" {shape: diamond}
f1: "Fixed: Should.Throw<T>(act).Message.ShouldContain(lit, Case.Insensitive)\n(proof: message-contains)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f2: "Fixed: ...Message.ShouldStartWith(lit, Case.Insensitive)\n(proof: message-starts)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f3: "Fixed: ...Message.ShouldEndWith(lit, Case.Insensitive)\n(proof: message-ends)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f4: "Fixed: ...Message.ShouldBe(lit[, because], StringCompareShould.IgnoreCase)\n(proof: message-exact, message-exact-because, message-because)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
start -> q1
q1 -> m1: nee
q1 -> q2: ja
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> m4: nee
q4 -> q5: ja
q5 -> m5: nee
q5 -> q6: ja
q6 -> m6: nee
q6 -> q7: ja
q7 -> m7: nee
q7 -> q8: ja
q8 -> f0: nee
q8 -> w1: ja
w1 -> mw1: nee
w1 -> w2: ja
w2 -> mw2: nee
w2 -> w3: ja
w3 -> mw3: nee
w3 -> sel: ja
sel -> f1: "*lit*"
sel -> f2: "lit*"
sel -> f3: "*lit"
sel -> f4: "lit"
